[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11341.95, "timestamp": "03:09:01", "text": "嗯，在我结束之前，好吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11345.269, "timestamp": "03:09:05", "text": "所以明天我们会有一场直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11348.95, "timestamp": "03:09:08", "text": "早上，或者甚至呃呃，当我醒来的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11352.07, "timestamp": "03:09:12", "text": "我们将在V聊天中讨论一些事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11355.389, "timestamp": "03:09:15", "text": "会是，呃，就像，该怎么称呼它呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11358.79, "timestamp": "03:09:18", "text": "就像……参观所有虚拟世界"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11359.99, "timestamp": "03:09:19", "text": "市场"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11364.349, "timestamp": "03:09:24", "text": "2022年冬季版所有东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11367.07, "timestamp": "03:09:27", "text": "虚拟市场的东西我从来没去过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11370.269, "timestamp": "03:09:30", "text": "我对这个虚拟市场的东西一直都很感兴趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11373.349, "timestamp": "03:09:33", "text": "你以为你知道这会很有趣，因为为什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11376.95, "timestamp": "03:09:36", "text": "不，是的，我们会进行线上授课。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11379.309, "timestamp": "03:09:39", "text": "市场商品"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11384.03, "timestamp": "03:09:44", "text": "当然，嗨，呃，我们会进行虚拟的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11388.87, "timestamp": "03:09:48", "text": "市场上的东西，嗯，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11392.03, "timestamp": "03:09:52", "text": "呃，我需要设置一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11395.79, "timestamp": "03:09:55", "text": "对，还有关于流媒体的其他信息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11397.07, "timestamp": "03:09:57", "text": "哦，我的天哪"}]